      "title": "wtap: re-export pcapng_module.h",
      "message": "wtap: re-export pcapng_module.h\n\npcapng_module.h was moved out of the public headers by [1].\n\nRe-export it now that broken dependencies have been removed.\n\n[1] 6e05d4e7b4 headers: Stop shipping broken headers\n\nSigned-off-by: Adrian Moreno <amorenoz@redhat.com>\n",
